  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9TYytCO.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kc2YGgk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/554379889122213888.svg?label=Join us on Discord&logo=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&style=flat-square\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Generators 是 Mekanism 的官方扩展模块，添加了多种发电机和能量生产方式。如果没有此模块，你需要安装其他模组才能为你的 Mekanism 机器提供能量。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">功能特性：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">热能发电机</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">燃气发电机</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">生物燃料发电机</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">太阳能发电机</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">高级太阳能发电机</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">风力发电机</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">裂变反应堆</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">聚变反应堆</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">涡轮机</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">其他 Mekanism 模块链接：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Additions</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Tools</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>文档</strong>&nbsp;可在 Mekanism 的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwiki.aidancbrady.com%252fwiki%252fMain_Page\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方维基</a> 上找到，该维基由 IndieWikis 提供托管服务！目前仍在不断完善中，如果你有能力，请多多贡献！</p>\n<p><strong>源代码&nbsp;</strong>可在 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/mekanism-mod/Mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></strong> 上获取！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>通过 Patreon 支持开发团队：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=260704\" rel=\"nofollow\">aidancbrady</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/pupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>通过 Ko-fi 支持开发团队：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
